OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry start to the day, but
OL,6,Fshowers will start to develop from mid-
OL,7,Fmorning. Again, the risk of thunder
OL,8,Fand possible hail. Feeling warm and
OL,9,Fhumid with temperatures above average.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA bright end to the afternoon
OL,12,Fwith sunny spells giving way to clear
OL,13,Fspells overnight. Remaining dry with a
OL,14,Ffew mist and fog patches forming by
OL,15,Fdawn.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA bright start but soon
OL,18,Fturning cloudy from the west with
OL,19,Foutbreaks of rain reaching the region
OL,20,Ffrom early morning, these locally
OL,21,Fheavy and perhaps thundery, Mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
